# Control-plane graph for the AOI development repository.
#
# `scaffold/` is a byte-for-byte installation mirror, not a second runtime.
# `aoi_apps/` is a separate Nuxt application and receives its own graph only
# when the Dashboard installation profile is selected. Keeping either tree in
# the control-plane graph duplicates symbols and makes structural queries less
# precise without adding source authority.
# AOI managed Codebase Memory boundary: control-plane
scaffold/
aoi_apps/
